      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想起“有马纪念”后，\n优秀素质曾与目白家的两人谈话的事──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c1911d9f735b34907d380ced559c03dd6a6bf44e6980fd791db8e188bc2aeb5",
