      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我会让你见识比言语更确实的事物。\n那对你来说一定也很足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccb4c2b90df699a506a5bd13cef8c0a4cefb5011b02bdb86ec2566c7d94509d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
