      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06ae9dd2957998b387b3495",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论何时身体都是一切的本钱。\n我希望今年一年她能平安地跑完所有比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4251e0d892906bdac89f7b913f379d1e12290ef92c7051793d8ae470594e7814",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50e9166bc3394eedf06890d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了实现梦想，她还是需要变得更强。\n我希望她能得到自己期望的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21ddf9fdd4a755a904cb28aa2c45b023c39ddda6ada3dd753c44a361056a1cf2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd4c296ba537aeb8fd22fa04",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质目前已经学到了不少事。\n我希望她往后能够更加活跃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5d21b9aa84671a09e668861e13f571df6f7cf8bc9b239a88f7891d3811867e3",
